{"candidateAnswer":"Visually stunning with an unforgettable soundtrack that stayed with her for days.","evidence":"[D23:18 | 10:58 am on 9 October, 2022] Joanna: I watched a classic movie the other day that was awesome - the story was so gripping and the actors were great! It really stuck with me.","itemId":"urn:uuid:5202b499-80ea-593c-854d-dda9ad944ace","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:e139ff1367c726e0c7ab9dbff314f0bc1c812f5546a7e7efa213e2b88b267ed7","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How did Joanna describe the classic movie he watched?","referenceAnswer":"gripping with great actors","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"e139ff1367c726e0c7ab9dbff314f0bc1c812f5546a7e7efa213e2b88b267ed7"}}]}